  "description": "DRIT.Mail is a pure-managed .NET library for reading, writing, converting, signing, encrypting, and verifying Outlook/Exchange mail file formats — MSG, PST, EML, iCalendar, vCard, and MBOX — with a first-class, source-level RFC implementation layer (MIME, S/MIME, DKIM, CMS, ASN.1, X.509, DNS, SMTP, POP3, IMAP). Built around the MAPI object model with full property-level access, deep PST NDB/LTP fidelity, an in-house OLE Compound File engine, and zero external dependencies.",
